# kh2 pad v1   Open the pause menu in state 06: Start held k 200..203, cross (Items) k 280..283, circle (back) k 320..323,
# Start (close) k 360..363. The menu runs a stop every vsync.
# k   buttons   lx  ly  rx  ry
0     -         127 127 127 127
200   start
204   -
280   cross
284   -
320   circle
324   -
360   start
364   -
end 400
